    {
        "text": "The Year 937"
    },
    {
        "text": "Duke Erik and Professor Lierland D. of Piesberg Parliamentary University published this co-authored paper in The Journal of Urban History ('Where Did We Come From?' Issue 44)."
    },
    {
        "text": "The paper discussed the results of a detailed analysis of a collection of weathered remains."
    },
    {
        "text": "The investigation into Sargon Excavation Site 4 revealed a common origin for Infected quarantines and executions with the law itself."
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is to say, the suffering of the Infected predates even the emergence of the law."
    },
