    {
        "text": "L. G. D. and Rhodes Island Pharmaceuticals"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen Search-and-Destroy Campaign - Final Phase"
    },
    {
        "text": "1. Control Reunion's movements within Lungmen. Complete under the direction of the L. G. D."
    },
    {
        "text": "2. Mop up Reunion's forces still in Lungmen. Complete under the direction of the L. G. D."
    },
    {
        "text": "3. Eliminate Reunion's operational commander, or their command influence. Complete under the direction of the L. G. D."
    },
    {
        "text": "4. Eliminate the Reunion Movement before they can withdraw to the slums. Complete under a joint L. G. D. and Rhodes Island operation."
    },
