    {
        "text": "Now we're just caught up in an exercise? How dare they use such cheap tricks to cover up the exquisite terror I've worked so hard to formulate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "And to repeat it over and over again in both Lungmen and Ursine tongues!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've had enough of these drones. Get! Hurry! Keep to the side streets!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing from Scout Team 3 either!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Assault's signal suddenly c- cut out...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're losing contact with all our overwatch teams one by one!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why! How!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such an insult... such humiliation foisted upon our movement!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "But how, and why? Damn you, Lungmen! Damn the Lungmenites! Damn the uninfected!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(I've never seen him so unstable like this.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Faust, do we still have a chance to retreat?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'll make some space for you.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "(If it's just your run-of-the-mill cops with the L. G. D. plus Rhodes Island, we should be able to get away.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(What do you mean? Who else could be out there?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Agh...! I can't believe this! I can't get through!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can't even issue orders to my teams, how am I supposed to win?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Someone is watching us. There is still more to this city.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Get ready. To survive.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Got it.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...Faust.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hm?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(We trust you.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(......)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
