    {
        "text": "They're really leaving this to the Infected? Rhodes Island got a raw deal this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "And in Lungmen! Hmph. How could a city as big as Lungmen not have what it takes to fight off an invasion on its own?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now they've got Infected fighting Infected on behalf of the normies...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. It's certainly not the first time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
