    {
        "text": "Hurry up and clear a path! Don't look back, just break through their defenses!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we can just get across this street, we have a shot at grouping up with the second brigade!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't give them a chance to return fire. There aren't many of us left\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "And in a moment, there won't be any of you left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
