    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She blocked it with her bare hands?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seeing as how you continue to resist, there's nothing more I can say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As if we'd just let you lock us up? How crazy are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not crazy! There's a time and a place for fight, and a time and a place for flight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just that when you choose to fight, all I can do is fight back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Either way, I don't need my chainsaw.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I really don't want to fight my fellow Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "...it's so humid in Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
